# gameOS inittab — appliance-style boot, no login console.
# Mount virtual filesystems BEFORE rcS: udev, the data-partition setup and
# mesa all need /proc and /sys. Without them udevd cannot run, GAMEOS-DATA
# is never created and EGL fails to enumerate the GPU (UI boot loop).
::sysinit:/bin/mount -t proc proc /proc
::sysinit:/bin/mount -o remount,rw /
::sysinit:/bin/mkdir -p /dev/pts
::sysinit:/bin/mkdir -p /dev/shm
::sysinit:/bin/mount -a
::sysinit:/etc/init.d/rcS
::respawn:/usr/bin/gameos-session
::ctrlaltdel:/sbin/reboot
::shutdown:/etc/init.d/rcK